WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.491 --> 00:00:03.574
Lesson ten. Days of the Week!

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:11.847
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:14.460
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.905
Today we learn: Days of the Week! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.046
Monday! Say it with me. Monday!

6
00:00:26.998 --> 00:00:30.664
Tuesday! Say it with me. Tuesday!

7
00:00:34.891 --> 00:00:39.024
Wednesday! Say it with me. Wednesday!

8
00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:46.755
Thursday! Say it with me. Thursday!

9
00:00:50.729 --> 00:00:54.362
Friday! Say it with me. Friday!

10
00:00:58.355 --> 00:01:01.938
Saturday! Say it with me. Saturday!

11
00:01:05.943 --> 00:01:09.726
Sunday! Say it with me. Sunday!

12
00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:17.275
Today! Say it with me. Today!

13
00:01:21.339 --> 00:01:27.957
Listen. Today is Monday. Tomorrow is Tuesday.

14
00:01:28.007 --> 00:01:32.930
Say it with me. Today is Monday. Tomorrow is Tuesday.

15
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:43.611
We go to school on Monday. On Saturday and Sunday, we rest and play at home.

16
00:01:43.661 --> 00:01:45.067
I like this story!

17
00:01:45.766 --> 00:01:50.109
What day is it?

18
00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:51.501
It's Wednesday!

19
00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:56.847
What day is it?

20
00:01:56.897 --> 00:01:58.173
It's Saturday!

21
00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:08.160
This is S. S is for sun. S is for snake. This is T. T is for tree. T is for tiger.

22
00:02:12.172 --> 00:02:19.564
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:19.614 --> 00:02:21.200
Bye-bye, friends!

